Subject: [PATCH 13/14] PS1-RAM: docs: the package rebased on 0df72845 (129,456
 B below the stack top) and its checks

The rebased tree (CR3's gene code and creator string pool, Talk T5B-OPEN,
DC6A) ends 129,456 B below the stack top (origin's tip without the package:
68,368 B). Speed tour (218 windows), 23 harness scripts and game_smoke on
both: no window slower, the same SPU line; core tests 1119 passed (also with
SAN=1), check-gen, xcheck (408 files), GBA build and tests, dc-host-test.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
